Step 2. Python setup
Windows 11 mein PowerShell open karo.

Ye command run karo:

winget install --id Python.Python.3.12 -e

Installation complete hone ke baad PowerShell close karke dobara open karna.

Check:

python --version

Expected output approximately:

Python 3.12.x
Step 3. Android ADB setup
ADB is our communication tool for supported Android TV functions.

Download Android SDK Platform Tools from the link above.

Extract the ZIP file.

Put the extracted folder here:

C:\PuneetTools\platform-tools
Open that folder in File Explorer.

Click the address bar, type powershell and press Enter.

Run:

.\adb.exe version

You should see the Android Debug Bridge version.

Important: We will pair the TV only when you're physically near it and can approve the debugging permission on its screen. Android's official documentation describes wireless pairing on supported Android TV versions. 

Android Developers
+1

Step 4. Create our project
Copy these commands into PowerShell:

mkdir "$HOME\Puneet-AI-TV"
cd "$HOME\Puneet-AI-TV"

mkdir backend
mkdir dashboard
mkdir config

python -m venv .venv

.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

python -m pip install --upgrade pip

pip install fastapi uvicorn python-dotenv

