2. TV mein hum exactly kya-kya karenge?
Ye implementation roadmap rahega:

Stage 1 — TV Connection

OnePlus TV ka model, Android version, network control aur ADB compatibility check.

First priority
Stage 2 — Remote Replacement

Laptop se power, volume, apps aur input control.

Stage 3 — AI Assistant

Hindi/English command understanding, movie recommendations aur AI responses.

Stage 4 — Custom TV Interface

AI home screen, favorite apps aur shortcuts.

Stage 5 — DD Free Dish

HDMI-CEC/IR-based receiver control aur channel shortcuts.

Stage 6 — WhatsApp Integration

WhatsApp messages se commands aur status responses.

Stage 7 — Voice Assistant

Wake word, microphone, speech recognition aur voice responses.

Stage 8 — Smart Automation

Scheduled power, favorite entertainment shortcuts aur personalized routines.

