chat agr share kru kisi ko to wo isme question asnwer kr payega tumse?
Haan bhai! 😊 Agar tum ye ChatGPT conversation kisi ko Share karte ho, toh woh shared chat ko dekh sakta hai aur uske basis par aage questions poochne ke liye apni copy mein continue kar sakta hai.

Lekin ek important difference hai:

Tumhari original chat: Uske messages woh tumhari taraf se send nahi kar sakta.

Shared chat: Woh apni copy mein questions pooch sakta hai aur ChatGPT se answers le sakta hai.

Tumhari future conversations: Use automatically access nahi milta.

Puneet AI TV project ke liye: Tum apne developer ya team member ko chat share kar sakte ho. Woh project ke features, architecture aur implementation ke baare mein questions pooch sakta hai.

Bas dhyan rahe: shared link jiske paas hoga, woh conversation dekh sakta hai. Sensitive details share mat karna.

aur uski future conversation mujhe milengei?
Nahi bhai. 🙂

Agar tum kisi ko ChatGPT conversation ka shared link bhejte ho:

Woh apni copy mein aage questions pooch sakta hai.

Uske naye questions aur answers tumhari chat mein nahi dikhenge.

Tum uski future conversations access nahi kar sakte.

Tumhe uski chat history automatically nahi milegi.

Agar tum chahte ho ki tum aur tumhara developer dono project discussions dekh aur manage kar sako, toh shared link ke bajaye collaborative workspace ya shared project workflow use karna better rahega.




